  "bio": "Experience the exquisite artistry of Onen Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Falmouth, United Kingdom. This appointment-only studio boasts a collective of fine art graduates and apprentices who specialize in hand-drawn custom designs, with a mastery in fineline, dotwork, and illustrative styles. At Onen Tattoo, your vision is transformed into stunning ink, complete with professional cover-ups and piercing services in a serene and inspiring environment."
